      "writtenOn": "2022-01-13T18:12:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I split handling to *_transmit_op which is private and *_handle_sop_msg which is public. I did it to allow creating partner emulator which reuse sink/source specific code. Example of it is in next patch (crrev.com/c/3358579) where I crated DRP emulator which use both sink and source and add PR_SWP handling on top of that. I imagine that someone who wants to emulate an obscure USB-C device may use tcpci_snk_emul_data and embed it in obscure_dev_emul.",
